{"id":"T01","kind":"transportation","style":"list","features":[],"text":"We ship units from 2 warehouses to 4 stores. Supply: Delhi has 715 units; Kolkata has 535 units. Demand: Lucknow needs 350 units; Bengaluru needs 200 units; Hyderabad needs 400 units; Jaipur needs 300 units. Cost per unit: Delhi to Lucknow costs 3; Delhi to Bengaluru costs 24; Delhi to Hyderabad costs 28; Delhi to Jaipur costs 16; Kolkata to Lucknow costs 24; Kolkata to Bengaluru costs ₹12; Kolkata to Hyderabad costs ₹23; Kolkata to Jaipur costs ₹18. Find the shipping plan with the lowest total cost.","problem":{"kind":"transportation","name":"Warehouse to store shipping","sense":"minimize","sources":[{"id":"Delhi","supply":715.0},{"id":"Kolkata","supply":535.0}],"destinations":[{"id":"Lucknow","demand":350.0},{"id":"Bengaluru","demand":200.0},{"id":"Hyderabad","demand":400.0},{"id":"Jaipur","demand":300.0}],"routes":[{"source":"Delhi","destination":"Lucknow","cost":3.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Delhi","destination":"Bengaluru","cost":24.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Delhi","destination":"Hyderabad","cost":28.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Delhi","destination":"Jaipur","cost":16.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Kolkata","destination":"Lucknow","cost":24.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Kolkata","destination":"Bengaluru","cost":12.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Kolkata","destination":"Hyderabad","cost":23.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Kolkata","destination":"Jaipur","cost":18.0,"capacity":null}],"demand_constraint":"equal"},"expected_objective":17775.0}
{"id":"T02","kind":"transportation","style":"narrative","features":["blocked_route"],"text":"The factory in Plant C can send up to 40 tons, shipping to Austin at 3 per ton, Seattle at 8 per ton. The factory in Plant B can send up to 30 tons, shipping to Austin at 11 per ton, Seattle at 18 per ton, Denver at $19 per ton. Austin requires 20 tons. Seattle requires 20 tons. Denver requires 30 tons. Plant C cannot ship to Denver. Find the shipping plan with the lowest total cost.","problem":{"kind":"transportation","name":"Factory to city shipping","sense":"minimize","sources":[{"id":"Plant C","supply":40.0},{"id":"Plant B","supply":30.0}],"destinations":[{"id":"Austin","demand":20.0},{"id":"Seattle","demand":20.0},{"id":"Denver","demand":30.0}],"routes":[{"source":"Plant C","destination":"Austin","cost":3.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Plant C","destination":"Seattle","cost":8.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Plant B","destination":"Austin","cost":11.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Plant B","destination":"Seattle","cost":18.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Plant B","destination":"Denver","cost":19.0,"capacity":null}],"demand_constraint":"equal"},"expected_objective":790.0}
{"id":"T03","kind":"transportation","style":"table","features":["route_capacity","excess_supply"],"text":"Unit shipping costs from each farm to each market (crates):\n| from \\ to | South Market | North Market | West Market | Central Market | supply |\n| Sunny Fields | 9 | 28 | 26 | 27 | 7,578 |\n| Hill Farm | 11 | 4 | 27 | 27 | 4,461 |\n| Green Acres | 14 | 17 | 13 | 13 | 4,461 |\n| demand | 4,500 | 4,500 | 4,500 | 1,000 | |\nAt most 2,250 crates can go from Hill Farm to West Market.\nFind the shipping plan with the lowest total cost.","problem":{"kind":"transportation","name":"Farm to market shipping","sense":"minimize","sources":[{"id":"Sunny Fields","supply":7578.0},{"id":"Hill Farm","supply":4461.0},{"id":"Green Acres","supply":4461.0}],"destinations":[{"id":"South Market","demand":4500.0},{"id":"North Market","demand":4500.0},{"id":"West Market","demand":4500.0},{"id":"Central Market","demand":1000.0}],"routes":[{"source":"Sunny Fields","destination":"South Market","cost":9.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Sunny Fields","destination":"North Market","cost":28.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Sunny Fields","destination":"West Market","cost":26.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Sunny Fields","destination":"Central Market","cost":27.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Hill Farm","destination":"South Market","cost":11.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Hill Farm","destination":"North Market","cost":4.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Hill Farm","destination":"West Market","cost":27.0,"capacity":2250.0},{"source":"Hill Farm","destination":"Central Market","cost":27.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Green Acres","destination":"South Market","cost":14.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Green Acres","destination":"North Market","cost":17.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Green Acres","destination":"West Market","cost":13.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Green Acres","destination":"Central Market","cost":13.0,"capacity":null}],"demand_constraint":"equal"},"expected_objective":144443.0}
{"id":"T04","kind":"transportation","style":"list","features":["route_capacity","at_least_demand","excess_supply"],"text":"We ship bags from 3 blood banks to 3 hospitals. Supply: Bank 4 has 419 bags; Bank 2 has 218 bags; Bank 1 has 363 bags. Demand: Riverside needs at least 400 bags; Northgate needs at least 150 bags; City General needs at least 250 bags. Cost per bag: Bank 4 to Riverside costs 3; Bank 4 to Northgate costs €6; Bank 4 to City General costs €29; Bank 2 to Riverside costs 13; Bank 2 to Northgate costs €12; Bank 2 to City General costs 10; Bank 1 to Riverside costs 17; Bank 1 to Northgate costs 9; Bank 1 to City General costs €25. At most 125 bags can go from Bank 1 to City General. Find the shipping plan with the lowest total cost.","problem":{"kind":"transportation","name":"Blood Bank to hospital shipping","sense":"minimize","sources":[{"id":"Bank 4","supply":419.0},{"id":"Bank 2","supply":218.0},{"id":"Bank 1","supply":363.0}],"destinations":[{"id":"Riverside","demand":400.0},{"id":"Northgate","demand":150.0},{"id":"City General","demand":250.0}],"routes":[{"source":"Bank 4","destination":"Riverside","cost":3.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Bank 4","destination":"Northgate","cost":6.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Bank 4","destination":"City General","cost":29.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Bank 2","destination":"Riverside","cost":13.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Bank 2","destination":"Northgate","cost":12.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Bank 2","destination":"City General","cost":10.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Bank 1","destination":"Riverside","cost":17.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Bank 1","destination":"Northgate","cost":9.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Bank 1","destination":"City General","cost":25.0,"capacity":125.0}],"demand_constraint":"at_least"},"expected_objective":5473.0}
{"id":"T05","kind":"transportation","style":"narrative","features":["blocked_route","excess_supply"],"text":"The depot in Depot Y can send up to 3,313 pallets, shipping to Initech at 9 per pallet, Globex at $21 per pallet. The depot in Depot W can send up to 4,687 pallets, shipping to Initech at $25 per pallet, Globex at 27 per pallet, Acme at $28 per pallet. Initech requires 2,500 pallets. Globex requires 3,500 pallets. Acme requires 1,500 pallets. Depot Y cannot ship to Acme. Find the shipping plan with the lowest total cost.","problem":{"kind":"transportation","name":"Depot to customer shipping","sense":"minimize","sources":[{"id":"Depot Y","supply":3313.0},{"id":"Depot W","supply":4687.0}],"destinations":[{"id":"Initech","demand":2500.0},{"id":"Globex","demand":3500.0},{"id":"Acme","demand":1500.0}],"routes":[{"source":"Depot Y","destination":"Initech","cost":9.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Depot Y","destination":"Globex","cost":21.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Depot W","destination":"Initech","cost":25.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Depot W","destination":"Globex","cost":27.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Depot W","destination":"Acme","cost":28.0,"capacity":null}],"demand_constraint":"equal"},"expected_objective":154122.0}
