{"id":"T07","kind":"transportation","style":"list","features":["blocked_route"],"text":"We ship tons from 2 factorys to 2 citys. Supply: Plant D has 275 tons; Plant A has 275 tons. Demand: Miami needs 250 tons; Boston needs 300 tons. Cost per ton: Plant D to Boston costs $3; Plant A to Miami costs 18; Plant A to Boston costs $20. Plant D cannot ship to Miami. Find the shipping plan with the lowest total cost.","problem":{"kind":"transportation","name":"Factory to city shipping","sense":"minimize","sources":[{"id":"Plant D","supply":275.0},{"id":"Plant A","supply":275.0}],"destinations":[{"id":"Miami","demand":250.0},{"id":"Boston","demand":300.0}],"routes":[{"source":"Plant D","destination":"Boston","cost":3.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Plant A","destination":"Miami","cost":18.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Plant A","destination":"Boston","cost":20.0,"capacity":null}],"demand_constraint":"equal"},"expected_objective":5825.0}
{"id":"T08","kind":"transportation","style":"narrative","features":["blocked_route","at_least_demand","excess_supply"],"text":"The farm in Green Acres can send up to 56 crates, shipping to West Market at 7 per crate, North Market at 9 per crate, East Market at $3 per crate. The farm in Hill Farm can send up to 41 crates, shipping to West Market at 2 per crate, North Market at $14 per crate, East Market at 23 per crate. The farm in River Farm can send up to 13 crates, shipping to West Market at $16 per crate, North Market at $16 per crate. West Market requires at least 20 crates. North Market requires at least 35 crates. East Market requires at least 35 crates. River Farm cannot ship to East Market. Find the shipping plan with the lowest total cost.","problem":{"kind":"transportation","name":"Farm to market shipping","sense":"minimize","sources":[{"id":"Green Acres","supply":56.0},{"id":"Hill Farm","supply":41.0},{"id":"River Farm","supply":13.0}],"destinations":[{"id":"West Market","demand":20.0},{"id":"North Market","demand":35.0},{"id":"East Market","demand":35.0}],"routes":[{"source":"Green Acres","destination":"West Market","cost":7.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Green Acres","destination":"North Market","cost":9.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Green Acres","destination":"East Market","cost":3.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Hill Farm","destination":"West Market","cost":2.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Hill Farm","destination":"North Market","cost":14.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Hill Farm","destination":"East Market","cost":23.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"River Farm","destination":"West Market","cost":16.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"River Farm","destination":"North Market","cost":16.0,"capacity":null}],"demand_constraint":"at_least"},"expected_objective":530.0}
{"id":"T09","kind":"transportation","style":"table","features":["route_capacity"],"text":"Unit shipping costs from each blood bank to each hospital (bags):\n| from \\ to | City General | Riverside | St Mary | supply |\n| Bank 1 | 7 | 20 | 17 | 2,334 |\n| Bank 4 | 16 | 13 | 3 | 2,333 |\n| Bank 2 | 22 | 11 | 10 | 2,333 |\n| demand | 4,500 | 1,500 | 1,000 | |\nAt most 2,250 bags can go from Bank 1 to City General.\nFind the shipping plan with the lowest total cost.","problem":{"kind":"transportation","name":"Blood Bank to hospital shipping","sense":"minimize","sources":[{"id":"Bank 1","supply":2334.0},{"id":"Bank 4","supply":2333.0},{"id":"Bank 2","supply":2333.0}],"destinations":[{"id":"City General","demand":4500.0},{"id":"Riverside","demand":1500.0},{"id":"St Mary","demand":1000.0}],"routes":[{"source":"Bank 1","destination":"City General","cost":7.0,"capacity":2250.0},{"source":"Bank 1","destination":"Riverside","cost":20.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Bank 1","destination":"St Mary","cost":17.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Bank 4","destination":"City General","cost":16.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Bank 4","destination":"Riverside","cost":13.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Bank 4","destination":"St Mary","cost":3.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Bank 2","destination":"City General","cost":22.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Bank 2","destination":"Riverside","cost":11.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Bank 2","destination":"St Mary","cost":10.0,"capacity":null}],"demand_constraint":"equal"},"expected_objective":77424.0}
{"id":"T10","kind":"transportation","style":"list","features":[],"text":"We ship pallets from 3 depots to 3 customers. Supply: Depot X has 23 pallets; Depot W has 45 pallets; Depot Y has 22 pallets. Demand: Globex needs 10 pallets; Initech needs 40 pallets; Hooli needs 40 pallets. Cost per pallet: Depot X to Globex costs 16; Depot X to Initech costs $7; Depot X to Hooli costs $3; Depot W to Globex costs $20; Depot W to Initech costs $2; Depot W to Hooli costs $30; Depot Y to Globex costs $26; Depot Y to Initech costs $30; Depot Y to Hooli costs $12. Find the shipping plan with the lowest total cost.","problem":{"kind":"transportation","name":"Depot to customer shipping","sense":"minimize","sources":[{"id":"Depot X","supply":23.0},{"id":"Depot W","supply":45.0},{"id":"Depot Y","supply":22.0}],"destinations":[{"id":"Globex","demand":10.0},{"id":"Initech","demand":40.0},{"id":"Hooli","demand":40.0}],"routes":[{"source":"Depot X","destination":"Globex","cost":16.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Depot X","destination":"Initech","cost":7.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Depot X","destination":"Hooli","cost":3.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Depot W","destination":"Globex","cost":20.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Depot W","destination":"Initech","cost":2.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Depot W","destination":"Hooli","cost":30.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Depot Y","destination":"Globex","cost":26.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Depot Y","destination":"Initech","cost":30.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Depot Y","destination":"Hooli","cost":12.0,"capacity":null}],"demand_constraint":"equal"},"expected_objective":578.0}
{"id":"T11","kind":"transportation","style":"narrative","features":["at_least_demand","excess_supply"],"text":"The warehouse in Delhi can send up to 42 units, shipping to Hyderabad at ₹15 per unit, Bengaluru at ₹5 per unit, Lucknow at 6 per unit. The warehouse in Mumbai can send up to 53 units, shipping to Hyderabad at 23 per unit, Bengaluru at 17 per unit, Lucknow at ₹18 per unit. Hyderabad requires at least 25 units. Bengaluru requires at least 25 units. Lucknow requires at least 25 units. Find the shipping plan with the lowest total cost.","problem":{"kind":"transportation","name":"Warehouse to store shipping","sense":"minimize","sources":[{"id":"Delhi","supply":42.0},{"id":"Mumbai","supply":53.0}],"destinations":[{"id":"Hyderabad","demand":25.0},{"id":"Bengaluru","demand":25.0},{"id":"Lucknow","demand":25.0}],"routes":[{"source":"Delhi","destination":"Hyderabad","cost":15.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Delhi","destination":"Bengaluru","cost":5.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Delhi","destination":"Lucknow","cost":6.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Mumbai","destination":"Hyderabad","cost":23.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Mumbai","destination":"Bengaluru","cost":17.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Mumbai","destination":"Lucknow","cost":18.0,"capacity":null}],"demand_constraint":"at_least"},"expected_objective":946.0}
{"id":"T12","kind":"transportation","style":"table","features":["route_capacity"],"text":"Unit shipping costs from each factory to each city (tons):\n| from \\ to | Denver | Seattle | Boston | Austin | supply |\n| Plant A | 24 | 27 | 9 | 28 | 328 |\n| Plant D | 21 | 15 | 2 | 9 | 130 |\n| Plant C | 9 | 15 | 29 | 26 | 392 |\n| demand | 300 | 300 | 150 | 100 | |\nAt most 150 tons can go from Plant C to Denver.\nFind the shipping plan with the lowest total cost.","problem":{"kind":"transportation","name":"Factory to city shipping","sense":"minimize","sources":[{"id":"Plant A","supply":328.0},{"id":"Plant D","supply":130.0},{"id":"Plant C","supply":392.0}],"destinations":[{"id":"Denver","demand":300.0},{"id":"Seattle","demand":300.0},{"id":"Boston","demand":150.0},{"id":"Austin","demand":100.0}],"routes":[{"source":"Plant A","destination":"Denver","cost":24.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Plant A","destination":"Seattle","cost":27.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Plant A","destination":"Boston","cost":9.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Plant A","destination":"Austin","cost":28.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Plant D","destination":"Denver","cost":21.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Plant D","destination":"Seattle","cost":15.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Plant D","destination":"Boston","cost":2.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Plant D","destination":"Austin","cost":9.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Plant C","destination":"Denver","cost":9.0,"capacity":150.0},{"source":"Plant C","destination":"Seattle","cost":15.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Plant C","destination":"Boston","cost":29.0,"capacity":null},{"source":"Plant C","destination":"Austin","cost":26.0,"capacity":null}],"demand_constraint":"equal"},"expected_objective":12036.0}
{"id":"A01","kind":"assignment","style":"sentences","features":[],"text":"Dina's hours by job: Testing 2, Assembly 49, Painting 19, Welding 58. Eli's hours by job: Testing 53, Assembly 58, Painting 23, Welding 46. Asha's hours by job: Testing 42, Assembly 7, Painting 60, Welding 9. Chen's hours by job: Testing 29, Assembly 34, Painting 17, Welding 14. Each job needs exactly one worker. Each worker can take at most one job. Find the assignment that minimizes the total hours.","problem":{"kind":"assignment","name":"Assign workers to jobs","sense":"minimize","agents":[{"id":"Dina","capacity":1},{"id":"Eli","capacity":1},{"id":"Asha","capacity":1},{"id":"Chen","capacity":1}],"tasks":[{"id":"Testing","required":1},{"id":"Assembly","required":1},{"id":"Painting","required":1},{"id":"Welding","required":1}],"pairings":[{"agent":"Dina","task":"Testing","value":2.0},{"agent":"Dina","task":"Assembly","value":49.0},{"agent":"Dina","task":"Painting","value":19.0},{"agent":"Dina","task":"Welding","value":58.0},{"agent":"Eli","task":"Testing","value":53.0},{"agent":"Eli","task":"Assembly","value":58.0},{"agent":"Eli","task":"Painting","value":23.0},{"agent":"Eli","task":"Welding","value":46.0},{"agent":"Asha","task":"Testing","value":42.0},{"agent":"Asha","task":"Assembly","value":7.0},{"agent":"Asha","task":"Painting","value":60.0},{"agent":"Asha","task":"Welding","value":9.0},{"agent":"Chen","task":"Testing","value":29.0},{"agent":"Chen","task":"Assembly","value":34.0},{"agent":"Chen","task":"Painting","value":17.0},{"agent":"Chen","task":"Welding","value":14.0}]},"expected_objective":46.0}
{"id":"A02","kind":"assignment","style":"table","features":["task_needs_two"],"text":"Preference score for each TA (rows) and lab section (columns):\n| | L2 | L1 | L4 | L3 |\n| Ravi | 2 | 8 | 2 | 8 |\n| Omar | 10 | 8 | 4 | 4 |\n| Lena | 8 | 5 | 9 | 9 |\n| Meera | 7 | 4 | 4 | 5 |\n| Tom | 2 | 5 | 3 | 2 |\nL2 needs two TAs.\nEvery other lab section needs exactly one TA.\nEach TA can take at most one lab section.\nFind the assignment that maximizes the total preference score.","problem":{"kind":"assignment","name":"Assign TAs to lab sections","sense":"maximize","agents":[{"id":"Ravi","capacity":1},{"id":"Omar","capacity":1},{"id":"Lena","capacity":1},{"id":"Meera","capacity":1},{"id":"Tom","capacity":1}],"tasks":[{"id":"L2","required":2},{"id":"L1","required":1},{"id":"L4","required":1},{"id":"L3","required":1}],"pairings":[{"agent":"Ravi","task":"L2","value":2.0},{"agent":"Ravi","task":"L1","value":8.0},{"agent":"Ravi","task":"L4","value":2.0},{"agent":"Ravi","task":"L3","value":8.0},{"agent":"Omar","task":"L2","value":10.0},{"agent":"Omar","task":"L1","value":8.0},{"agent":"Omar","task":"L4","value":4.0},{"agent":"Omar","task":"L3","value":4.0},{"agent":"Lena","task":"L2","value":8.0},{"agent":"Lena","task":"L1","value":5.0},{"agent":"Lena","task":"L4","value":9.0},{"agent":"Lena","task":"L3","value":9.0},{"agent":"Meera","task":"L2","value":7.0},{"agent":"Meera","task":"L1","value":4.0},{"agent":"Meera","task":"L4","value":4.0},{"agent":"Meera","task":"L3","value":5.0},{"agent":"Tom","task":"L2","value":2.0},{"agent":"Tom","task":"L1","value":5.0},{"agent":"Tom","task":"L4","value":3.0},{"agent":"Tom","task":"L3","value":2.0}]},"expected_objective":39.0}
{"id":"A03","kind":"assignment","style":"sentences","features":[],"text":"Nurse Brown's cost by shift: Evening 56, Morning 56, Weekend 31, Night 17. Nurse Kim's cost by shift: Evening 50, Morning 43, Weekend 13, Night 38. Nurse Lopez's cost by shift: Evening 42, Morning 53, Weekend 35, Night 7. Nurse Patel's cost by shift: Evening 33, Morning 45, Weekend 24, Night 34. Each shift needs exactly one nurse. Each nurse can take at most one shift. Find the assignment that minimizes the total cost.","problem":{"kind":"assignment","name":"Assign nurses to shifts","sense":"minimize","agents":[{"id":"Nurse Brown","capacity":1},{"id":"Nurse Kim","capacity":1},{"id":"Nurse Lopez","capacity":1},{"id":"Nurse Patel","capacity":1}],"tasks":[{"id":"Evening","required":1},{"id":"Morning","required":1},{"id":"Weekend","required":1},{"id":"Night","required":1}],"pairings":[{"agent":"Nurse Brown","task":"Evening","value":56.0},{"agent":"Nurse Brown","task":"Morning","value":56.0},{"agent":"Nurse Brown","task":"Weekend","value":31.0},{"agent":"Nurse Brown","task":"Night","value":17.0},{"agent":"Nurse Kim","task":"Evening","value":50.0},{"agent":"Nurse Kim","task":"Morning","value":43.0},{"agent":"Nurse Kim","task":"Weekend","value":13.0},{"agent":"Nurse Kim","task":"Night","value":38.0},{"agent":"Nurse Lopez","task":"Evening","value":42.0},{"agent":"Nurse Lopez","task":"Morning","value":53.0},{"agent":"Nurse Lopez","task":"Weekend","value":35.0},{"agent":"Nurse Lopez","task":"Night","value":7.0},{"agent":"Nurse Patel","task":"Evening","value":33.0},{"agent":"Nurse Patel","task":"Morning","value":45.0},{"agent":"Nurse Patel","task":"Weekend","value":24.0},{"agent":"Nurse Patel","task":"Night","value":34.0}]},"expected_objective":109.0}
{"id":"A04","kind":"assignment","style":"table","features":["agent_takes_two","forbidden_pair"],"text":"Cost for each driver (rows) and route (columns):\n| | Route North | Route East | Route West |\n| Driver 4 | 39 | 49 | 13 |\n| Driver 3 | 21 | 17 | - |\n| Driver 1 | 52 | 52 | 54 |\nA dash means that pairing is not allowed.\nEach route needs exactly one driver.\nDriver 4 can take two routes.\nEvery other driver can take at most one route.\nFind the assignment that minimizes the total cost.","problem":{"kind":"assignment","name":"Assign drivers to routes","sense":"minimize","agents":[{"id":"Driver 4","capacity":2},{"id":"Driver 3","capacity":1},{"id":"Driver 1","capacity":1}],"tasks":[{"id":"Route North","required":1},{"id":"Route East","required":1},{"id":"Route West","required":1}],"pairings":[{"agent":"Driver 4","task":"Route North","value":39.0},{"agent":"Driver 4","task":"Route East","value":49.0},{"agent":"Driver 4","task":"Route West","value":13.0},{"agent":"Driver 3","task":"Route North","value":21.0},{"agent":"Driver 3","task":"Route East","value":17.0},{"agent":"Driver 1","task":"Route North","value":52.0},{"agent":"Driver 1","task":"Route East","value":52.0},{"agent":"Driver 1","task":"Route West","value":54.0}]},"expected_objective":69.0}
{"id":"A05","kind":"assignment","style":"sentences","features":["spare_agent"],"text":"Ana's rating by client: Client Gamma 7, Client Beta 5, Client Delta 7, Client Alpha 9. Bo's rating by client: Client Gamma 10, Client Beta 2, Client Delta 7, Client Alpha 3. Eva's rating by client: Client Gamma 1, Client Beta 2, Client Delta 10, Client Alpha 5. Dev's rating by client: Client Gamma 8, Client Beta 1, Client Delta 4, Client Alpha 5. Cy's rating by client: Client Gamma 8, Client Beta 4, Client Delta 8, Client Alpha 4. Each client needs exactly one consultant. Each consultant can take at most one client. Find the assignment that maximizes the total rating.","problem":{"kind":"assignment","name":"Assign consultants to clients","sense":"maximize","agents":[{"id":"Ana","capacity":1},{"id":"Bo","capacity":1},{"id":"Eva","capacity":1},{"id":"Dev","capacity":1},{"id":"Cy","capacity":1}],"tasks":[{"id":"Client Gamma","required":1},{"id":"Client Beta","required":1},{"id":"Client Delta","required":1},{"id":"Client Alpha","required":1}],"pairings":[{"agent":"Ana","task":"Client Gamma","value":7.0},{"agent":"Ana","task":"Client Beta","value":5.0},{"agent":"Ana","task":"Client Delta","value":7.0},{"agent":"Ana","task":"Client Alpha","value":9.0},{"agent":"Bo","task":"Client Gamma","value":10.0},{"agent":"Bo","task":"Client Beta","value":2.0},{"agent":"Bo","task":"Client Delta","value":7.0},{"agent":"Bo","task":"Client Alpha","value":3.0},{"agent":"Eva","task":"Client Gamma","value":1.0},{"agent":"Eva","task":"Client Beta","value":2.0},{"agent":"Eva","task":"Client Delta","value":10.0},{"agent":"Eva","task":"Client Alpha","value":5.0},{"agent":"Dev","task":"Client Gamma","value":8.0},{"agent":"Dev","task":"Client Beta","value":1.0},{"agent":"Dev","task":"Client Delta","value":4.0},{"agent":"Dev","task":"Client Alpha","value":5.0},{"agent":"Cy","task":"Client Gamma","value":8.0},{"agent":"Cy","task":"Client Beta","value":4.0},{"agent":"Cy","task":"Client Delta","value":8.0},{"agent":"Cy","task":"Client Alpha","value":4.0}]},"expected_objective":33.0}
