{"id":"A09","kind":"assignment","style":"sentences","features":["task_needs_two","forbidden_pair","spare_agent"],"text":"Driver 1's cost by route: Route South 40, Route West 43, Route North 2. Driver 5's cost by route: Route South 54, Route West 58. Driver 2's cost by route: Route South 34, Route West 12, Route North 52. Driver 4's cost by route: Route South 18, Route West 13, Route North 48. Driver 3's cost by route: Route South 15, Route West 37, Route North 17. Driver 5 cannot be assigned to Route North. Route South needs two drivers. Every other route needs exactly one driver. Each driver can take at most one route. Find the assignment that minimizes the total cost.","problem":{"kind":"assignment","name":"Assign drivers to routes","sense":"minimize","agents":[{"id":"Driver 1","capacity":1},{"id":"Driver 5","capacity":1},{"id":"Driver 2","capacity":1},{"id":"Driver 4","capacity":1},{"id":"Driver 3","capacity":1}],"tasks":[{"id":"Route South","required":2},{"id":"Route West","required":1},{"id":"Route North","required":1}],"pairings":[{"agent":"Driver 1","task":"Route South","value":40.0},{"agent":"Driver 1","task":"Route West","value":43.0},{"agent":"Driver 1","task":"Route North","value":2.0},{"agent":"Driver 5","task":"Route South","value":54.0},{"agent":"Driver 5","task":"Route West","value":58.0},{"agent":"Driver 2","task":"Route South","value":34.0},{"agent":"Driver 2","task":"Route West","value":12.0},{"agent":"Driver 2","task":"Route North","value":52.0},{"agent":"Driver 4","task":"Route South","value":18.0},{"agent":"Driver 4","task":"Route West","value":13.0},{"agent":"Driver 4","task":"Route North","value":48.0},{"agent":"Driver 3","task":"Route South","value":15.0},{"agent":"Driver 3","task":"Route West","value":37.0},{"agent":"Driver 3","task":"Route North","value":17.0}]},"expected_objective":47.0}
