{"id":"A11","kind":"assignment","style":"sentences","features":["forbidden_pair"],"text":"Chen's hours by job: Welding 40, Painting 32. Asha's hours by job: Testing 19, Welding 14, Painting 55. Dina's hours by job: Testing 53, Welding 32, Painting 4. Chen cannot be assigned to Testing. Each job needs exactly one worker. Each worker can take at most one job. Find the assignment that minimizes the total hours.","problem":{"kind":"assignment","name":"Assign workers to jobs","sense":"minimize","agents":[{"id":"Chen","capacity":1},{"id":"Asha","capacity":1},{"id":"Dina","capacity":1}],"tasks":[{"id":"Testing","required":1},{"id":"Welding","required":1},{"id":"Painting","required":1}],"pairings":[{"agent":"Chen","task":"Welding","value":40.0},{"agent":"Chen","task":"Painting","value":32.0},{"agent":"Asha","task":"Testing","value":19.0},{"agent":"Asha","task":"Welding","value":14.0},{"agent":"Asha","task":"Painting","value":55.0},{"agent":"Dina","task":"Testing","value":53.0},{"agent":"Dina","task":"Welding","value":32.0},{"agent":"Dina","task":"Painting","value":4.0}]},"expected_objective":63.0}
